    "text": "Idaho\nCan You Legally Gather and Eat Roadkill in Idaho and Why Would You?\nBy Nate Bird,\n9 hours agoI just got home from a family vacation to California and we saw a lot of roadkill along the way. I’m the dad who will point it out every single time. But I have never had any desire to pull my car over and load the carcass into the back seat so we could take it home for dinner.",
